WHO Child Growth Standards data
================================

The reference tables bundled in src/data/ are published by the World Health
Organization as part of the WHO Child Growth Standards and are reproduced
here for computational use.

Source: https://www.who.int/tools/child-growth-standards

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or certified by the World
Health Organization. The MIT license in LICENSE applies to the source code of
this package; the underlying reference data remains the work of the WHO.

The tables are generated, never edited by hand — see scripts/generate-data.py
for the exact source URLs and the regeneration procedure.
